## Article 45. Inadmissibility of Applications

```catala
declaration scope Article45Admissibility:
  input app content Application
  output isAdmissible content YesNo

scope Article45Admissibility:
  label default_admissible definition isAdmissible equals Yes
  
  label inadmissible_exception exception default_admissible
  definition isAdmissible under condition
    app.isAnonymous = Yes
    or app.isRepeated = Yes
    or app.isCourtPending = Yes
    or app.containsAbuse = Yes
    or app.isAntiState = Yes
    consequence equals No
```
